{
  "$comment": "What the factusync CLI relies on from the FactuSync MCP server. Checked on both sides: apps/factusync/backend/src/mcp/mcp-cli-contract.spec.ts (the backend tools still look like this) and packages/factusync-cli/test/tool-contract.spec.ts (the CLI still calls exactly this). Not published.",
  "tools": {
